ts (= reductions in the amount of money that is available ) The department has suffered severe budget cuts.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('5b4840e7-2577-5a4e-8df5-8617855d468c','732708f4-2e2b-5e98-a441-270f40f1424c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to carefully plan and control how much money you spend and what you will buy with it',null,null,'به دقت برنامه ریزی و کنترل کنید که چقدر پول خرج می کنید و با آن چه چیزی می خرید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’ll have to budget more carefully.","translation":"ما باید با دقت بیشتری بودجه بندی کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000908769.mp3"},{"sentence":"This scheme enables you to budget the cost through fixed monthly payments.","translation":"این طرح شما را قادر می سازد تا هزینه را از طریق پرداخت های ماهانه ثابت بودجه بندی کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639499.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ve budgeted for a new car next year.","translation":"ما برای یک ماشین جدید در سال آینده بودجه تعیین کرده ایم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000908773.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5090ded2-571d-5ce1-9d6c-8f40f4ca8cbd','732708f4-2e2b-5e98-a441-270f40f1424c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if you budget something such as time, you decide how much of it you will need',null,null,'اگر به چیزی مانند زمان بودجه اختصاص دهید، تصمیم می گیرید که چقدر از آن نیاز دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b6dadeec-0eb6-5f54-b252-15f27e82b02c','94eb777d-9381-5b24-a6dc-66dbd6d121a7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','very low in price – often used in advertisements',null,null,'قیمت بسیار پایین - اغلب در تبلیغات استفاده می شود',array['cheap']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"budget flights","translation":"پروازهای مقرون به صرفه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000908789.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('70935964-691f-50ca-bddf-17213a50ac41','94eb777d-9381-5b24-a6dc-66dbd6d121a7',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'low-budget/big-budget',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a7442866-fa92-5563-bd71-018c42612397','374c5f2a-75c6-5108-9e28-79a3ef96eb99',1,null,null,'spoken & written','in the UK, a plan for how the government will collect all the money it needs, which is announced each year by the Chancellor of the Exchequer (= the minister in charge of financial matters ) . The Chancellor is always shown going to Parliament carrying a special red case that contains the Budget speech . The speech is broadcast on television and radio , and most people take an interest in the effects of the Budget on taxes and on the price of things like petrol , alcohol , and cigarettes .',null,null,'در انگلستان، طرحی برای نحوه جمع آوری تمام پول مورد نیاز دولت که هر سال توسط وزیر دارایی (= وزیر مسئول امور مالی) اعلام می شود. صدراعظم همیشه در حال رفتن به پارلمان در حالی که یک جعبه قرمز مخصوص که حاوی سخنرانی بودجه است نشان داده می شود. این سخنرانی از تلویزیون و رادیو پخش می شود و بیشتر مردم به تأثیرات بودجه بر مالیات و قیمت چیزهایی مانند بنزین، الکل و سیگار علاقه مند هستند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('2fba1d59-c2af-5bd9-a42d-6612a51c5ac2','82131aaa-e670-57a2-b38e-b207b0568644',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a solid yellow food made from milk or cream that you spread on bread or use in cooking',null,'bread-and-butter','کره (حیوانی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['salted/unsalted (= with or without salt in it ) Unsalted butter is better for baking. Most butter is slightly salted.','melted butter (= heated until it is liquid ) Brush the pastry with a little melted butter.','a pat of butter (= a small flat piece ) Breakfast was a small roll and a pat of butter.','a knob of butter (= a small round piece ) Add a knob of butter to the meat juices in the pan.','a lump of butter He served himself a big lump of butter.','spread butter on something Lee was spreading butter on his toast.','spread something with butter Spread the warm crumpets with butter.','melt butter Melt the butter and mix it with the other ingredients.','soften butter First soften the butter in a warm place.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b5b5b6fd-b58f-5dfc-a7b4-4f07556e403b','82131aaa-e670-57a2-b38e-b207b0568644',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'butter wouldn’t melt in somebody’s mouth','کره (حیوانی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['salted/unsalted (= with or without salt in it ) Unsalted butter is better for baking. Most butter is slightly salted.','melted butter (= heated until it is liquid ) Brush the pastry with a little melted butter.','a pat of butter (= a small flat piece ) Breakfast was a small roll and a pat of butter.','a knob of butter (= a small round piece ) Add a knob of butter to the meat juices in the pan.','a lump of butter He served himself a big lump of butter.','spread butter on something Lee was spreading butter on his toast.','spread something with butter Spread the warm crumpets with butter.','melt butter Melt the butter and mix it with the other ingredients.','soften butter First soften the butter in a warm place.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a431cf32-f2be-572d-8966-f08656f8e110','5dcc3396-212b-5ec8-b551-77151e2fb91b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to spread butter on something',null,null,'روی چیزی کره بمالند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"buttered toast","translation":"نان تست کره ای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001047755.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1d9e7ff7-9452-59ce-9b82-d0eaa2a24c86','c4044523-3c72-56b1-9129-42e52781ab44',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a small round flat object on your shirt , coat etc that you pass through a hole to fasten it',null,null,'دکمه؛ کلید (رایانه)؛ پیوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['fasten a button Small children can''t fasten their own buttons.','do up a button (= fasten it ) He quickly did up the buttons on his shirt.','unfasten a button Can you unfasten this button for me?','undo a button (= unfasten it ) I can''t undo the buttons on the back of this dress.','a button is missing Two of the buttons on the jacket were missing.','a button comes off something A button has come off my skirt.','something has lost a button His favourite shirt had lost a button.','sew on a button It doesn''t take a minute to sew on a button.','the top/bottom button He was wearing a white shirt with the top button undone.','a shirt/skirt/coat etc button Is this your coat button?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"small pearl buttons","translation":"دکمه های مروارید کوچک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000240.mp3"},{"sentence":"A button was missing from his shirt.","translation":"یک دکمه از پیراهنش کم بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000241.mp3"},{"sentence":"She undid (= unfastened ) the buttons of her blouse.","translation":"دکمه های بلوزش را باز کرد (= باز کرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000242.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
