sional camera crew for any type of production.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e1c1a894-0ce6-5bb3-8146-991cec920a3f','3ee847cf-bb8d-5d66-a94e-e61d3ef91e8c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to decide that something that was officially planned will not happen','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'لغو کردن، منتفی کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Our flight was cancelled.","translation":"پرواز ما کنسل شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677356.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m afraid I’ll have to cancel our meeting tomorrow.","translation":"می ترسم مجبور باشم جلسه فردا را لغو کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677357.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’ll just have to ring John and cancel.","translation":"فقط باید به جان زنگ بزنی و کنسل کنی.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677358.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2af4a3d9-608a-5940-ab79-c0e2a8758ea4','3ee847cf-bb8d-5d66-a94e-e61d3ef91e8c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to end an agreement or arrangement that you have with someone','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'برای پایان دادن به توافق یا توافقی که با کسی دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I phoned the hotel to cancel my reservation.","translation":"برای لغو رزرو با هتل تماس گرفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677360.mp3"},{"sentence":"The bank agreed to cancel all the company’s debts.","translation":"بانک موافقت کرد که تمام بدهی های شرکت را لغو کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677361.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('77388354-43f8-5d42-b5ea-ebbf67ad3a4f','3ee847cf-bb8d-5d66-a94e-e61d3ef91e8c',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to say officially that a document can no longer be used or no longer has any legal effect','[ transitive ]',null,'به طور رسمی بگوییم که یک سند دیگر قابل استفاده نیست یا دیگر اثر قانونی ندارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I phoned the bank to cancel the cheque.","translation":"برای ابطال چک با بانک تماس گرفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677366.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2e92784e-bf90-5496-ba2d-5039e71109d2','a615ceec-76c3-5215-bf41-9d2b0959a5b5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a very serious disease in which cells in one part of the body start to grow in a way that is not normal','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'سرطان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A lot of cancers can now be treated successfully.","translation":"اکنون بسیاری از سرطان ها را می توان با موفقیت درمان کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677374.mp3"},{"sentence":"Smoking causes lung cancer.","translation":"سیگار باعث سرطان ریه می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000893744.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was told last year that she had cancer .","translation":"سال گذشته به او گفته شد که سرطان دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677377.mp3"},{"sentence":"He died of cancer last month.","translation":"او ماه گذشته بر اثر سرطان درگذشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677381.mp3"},{"sentence":"cancer of the womb","translation":"سرطان رحم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677387.mp3"},{"sentence":"a new treatment which effectively kills cancer cells","translation":"درمان جدیدی که به طور موثر سلول های سرطانی را از بین می برد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677388.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('0384e102-f7bc-550d-9de8-9f9ef90e7a89','a615ceec-76c3-5215-bf41-9d2b0959a5b5',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an evil influence that affects a lot of people and is difficult to stop','[ countable ]',null,'تأثیر شیطانی که بر افراد زیادی تأثیر می گذارد و متوقف کردن آن دشوار است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Drug abuse is the cancer of our society.","translation":"مصرف مواد مخدر سرطان جامعه ماست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677394.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9236d4ec-6b08-5118-9413-a49aac5e15be','0b258c3e-6608-50f0-85c7-c909e9edb9fd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the fourth sign of the zodiac , represented by a crab , which some people believe affects the character and life of people born between June 22 and July 23','[ uncountable ]',null,'چهارمین علامت زودیاک که با یک خرچنگ نشان داده می شود و برخی معتقدند که بر شخصیت و زندگی متولدین 22 ژوئن تا 23 جولای تأثیر می گذارد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f815ec3e-1bdd-5e73-903e-33e69aa1e7d2','0b258c3e-6608-50f0-85c7-c909e9edb9fd',2,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who was born between June 22 and July 23','[ countable ]',null,'کسی که بین 22 ژوئن تا 23 جولای متولد شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e6048610-f375-50a3-ba81-591561309923','6449e413-b05e-5ce5-bafd-eb906ee598b1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a stick of wax with a string through the middle , which you burn to give light',null,null,'شمع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['light a candle She lit a candle in the church.','blow out a candle Can you blow out all the candles on your birthday cake?','a candle burns (= is giving out light ) The house was dark except for one candle burning in a window.','a candle flickers (= the flame moves in an unsteady way ) As the door opened, the candles flickered unsteadily.','a candle goes out A sudden draught made the candles go out.','a lighted candle A procession moved through the village carrying lighted candles.','a flickering candle (= with the flame moving unsteadily ) The church was full of flickering white candles.','a candle flame The candle flame flickered.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('bc4b3dc3-beb6-5b6a-a1b4-2d3134c7ced5','6449e413-b05e-5ce5-bafd-eb906ee598b1',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'can’t hold a candle to somebody/something','شمع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['light a candle She lit a candle in the church.','blow out a candle Can you blow out all the candles on your birthday cake?','a candle burns (= is giving out light ) The house was dark except for one candle burning in a window.','a candle flickers (= the flame moves in an unsteady way ) As the door opened, the candles flickered unsteadily.','a candle goes out A sudden draught made the candles go out.','a lighted candle A procession moved through the village carrying lighted candles.','a flickering candle (= with the flame moving unsteadily ) The church was full of flickering white candles.','a candle flame The candle flame flickered.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('62ba24f9-834b-5c96-8612-e9b5f45c39ed','456ace8b-495d-5ec9-820e-b889709a6296',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a job or profession that you have been trained for, and which you do for a long period of your life',null,null,'شغل، حرفه، مسیر شغلی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a successful career David had had a successful career in banking.','a distinguished/brilliant career (= very successful ) She retired last year after a distinguished career as a barrister.','a glittering career (= very successful, especially in sport or acting ) Winning the gold medal was the highlight of her glittering career.','a promising career (= likely to be successful ) She gave up a promising career in advertising in order to look after her children.','a political/medical/military etc career The scandal ruined his political career.','a teaching/acting/sporting career Her acting career lasted for more than 50 years.','a professional career You have to be outstanding to have a professional career in music.','somebody’s chosen career His parents encouraged him in his chosen career as a scientist.','have a career All my sons had careers in education.','make a career It isn’t easy to make a career in journalism.','pursue a career (= try to make a successful career ) She left teaching to pursue a career as a psychologist.','begin/start out on/start a career Jacobson started his banking career in 1990.','launch/embark on a career (= start one ) Rita went to New York where she launched her dancing career.','build a career (= make it develop ) She built her literary career by writing about crime.','change career People may change careers as many as seven times in their lives.','revive/resurrect your career (= make it successful again ) The singer is seeking to revive his pop career.','somebody’s career takes off (= starts to be successful ) His career took off and he started making a lot of money.','career development/advancement/progression A good job offers a programme of training and career development.','career opportunities Students often know little about the career opportunities available to them.','career prospects (= opportunities to get a good job or a better position ) Good computer skills will improve your career prospects.','a career path (= a way of making a career ) There’s no fixed career path for becoming an actor.','a career structure (= a system for making progress in a career ) Teaching offers a clear career structure.','the career ladder (= the way to higher positions in a career ) Having children can disturb your progress up the career ladder.','a career change/move After ten years in the job, I realized that I needed to make a career change.','a career woman (= one whose job is very important to her ) Career women tend to marry later.','careers advice/guidance Most universities offer professional careers advice.','a careers officer (= someone who gives careers advice ) If you’re not sure what to do, why don’t you talk to a careers officer?','a career in journalism/politics/teaching etc At the age of 15, he knew he wanted a career in politics.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a career in journalism","translation":"حرفه ای در روزنامه نگاری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001730681.mp3"},{"sentence":"a teaching career","translation":"یک حرفه تدریس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698839.mp3"},{"sentence":"He realized that his acting career was over.","translation":"او متوجه شد که دوران بازیگری اش به پایان رسیده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000895670.mp3"},{"sentence":"Career prospects within the company are excellent.","translation":"چشم انداز شغلی در شرکت عالی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698842.mp3"},{"sentence":"a physiotherapist who wanted to make a dramatic career change by becoming an author","translation":"فیزیوتراپیستی که می خواست با تبدیل شدن به یک نویسنده، تغییری شگرف در حرفه ایجاد کند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698843.mp3"},{"sentence":"Nurses want an improved career structure (= better opportunities to move upwards in their jobs ) .","translation":"پرستاران خواهان بهبود ساختار شغلی هستند (= فرصت های بهتر برای حرکت به سمت بالا در مشاغل خود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698847.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
