('7cb69945-3992-5047-a534-bc0e44c959ac','a72d4c84-e029-5982-9c03-da2772386b6c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to do something that you know involves a risk','[ transitive ]',null,'انجام کاری که می‌دانید ریسک دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I wasn’t sure if I’d got quite enough petrol to get me home, but I decided to chance it .","translation":"مطمئن نبودم که به اندازه کافی بنزین داشته باشم تا بتوانم به خانه برگردم یا نه، اما تصمیم گرفتم این اتفاق را بیاورم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687600.mp3"},{"sentence":"We decided not to chance our luck in the storm.","translation":"ما تصمیم گرفتیم شانس خود را در طوفان شانس ندهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687603.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’d never played before, but she was ready to chance her arm (= take a risk by doing something which may fail ) .","translation":"او قبلاً هرگز بازی نکرده بود، اما آماده بود که بازوی خود را شانس دهد (= ریسک کردن با انجام کاری که ممکن است شکست بخورد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687607.mp3"},{"sentence":"I decided to stay where I was. I couldn’t chance being seen.","translation":"تصمیم گرفتم همان جایی که بودم بمانم. من شانسی برای دیده شدن نداشتم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687614.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('cda37224-e3b1-5c20-8906-c81754d88f4e','a72d4c84-e029-5982-9c03-da2772386b6c',2,null,null,'literary','to happen in a way which is not expected and not planned','[ intransitive ]',null,'به گونه ای اتفاق بیفتد که انتظار نمی رود و برنامه ریزی نشده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She chanced to be passing when I came out of the house.","translation":"وقتی من از خانه بیرون آمدم او به طور اتفاقی در حال عبور بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001069489.mp3"},{"sentence":"It chanced that we both went to Paris that year.","translation":"اتفاقاً آن سال هر دو به پاریس رفتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001069492.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('974eb1ee-a4e6-5108-8ed3-8632e4646b7a','0ba0544e-4234-57f6-b91d-685e8afe6bd1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','not planned or expected',null,null,'برنامه ریزی یا انتظار نمی رود',array['accidental']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A chance meeting with a journalist changed everything.","translation":"ملاقات تصادفی با یک روزنامه نگار همه چیز را تغییر داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687298.mp3"},{"sentence":"A chance remark by one of his colleagues got him thinking.","translation":"اظهارات اتفاقی یکی از همکارانش او را به فکر فرو برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687299.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('66d95dfd-9795-53dc-a8d1-eb0c8ee28d69','6b9e192f-6090-536b-a15c-6f0887215847',1,'become different/make something different','متفاوت شدن / چیزی متفاوت ساختن','spoken & written','to become different, or to make something become different','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'تغییر کردن؛ تغییر دادن؛ عوض کردن (قطار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['dramatically/drastically/radically (= a lot ) People’s work environment has changed dramatically in the past twenty years.','completely His life had completely changed since he met Anya.','considerably He has changed considerably in four years.','significantly The legal system has changed significantly since the rule was established.','fundamentally The political situation has fundamentally changed.','rapidly/quickly The market for phones is changing rapidly.','slowly/gradually Things are gradually changing.','change overnight (= very quickly ) Old habits cannot be changed overnight.','changing circumstances/conditions The human brain adapts quickly to changing conditions.','changing attitudes Changing attitudes cause traditional ways of life to disappear.','the changing role of somebody the changing role of women in society','changing patterns of work/behaviour etc Changing patterns of work mean that more people are able to work from home.','a changing environment In order to survive, you must adapt to a changing environment.','a changing world Children are growing up in a changing world.','changing times (= a period of time when a lot is changing ) We live in changing times.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Susan has changed a lot since I last saw her.","translation":"سوزان از آخرین باری که او را دیدم خیلی تغییر کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001069563.mp3"},{"sentence":"Changing your eating habits is the best way to lose weight.","translation":"تغییر عادات غذایی بهترین راه برای کاهش وزن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000284.mp3"},{"sentence":"The leaves on trees change colour in the autumn.","translation":"برگ های درختان در پاییز تغییر رنگ می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667040.mp3"},{"sentence":"He changed from being a nice lad to being rude and unhelpful.","translation":"او از یک پسر خوب به گستاخی و کمکی تبدیل شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667046.mp3"},{"sentence":"The hissing sound gradually changed into a low hum.","translation":"صدای خش خش کم کم به زمزمه ی آهسته تبدیل شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667049.mp3"},{"sentence":"A witch had changed him into a mouse.","translation":"یک جادوگر او را به یک موش تبدیل کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667052.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mueller changed his name to Miller when he became a U.S. citizen.","translation":"مولر زمانی که شهروند ایالات متحده شد نام خود را به میلر تغییر داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001976548.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('7cb9f709-71ef-5cfe-9ca7-baee70c99dcf','6b9e192f-6090-536b-a15c-6f0887215847',2,'start doing/using something different','شروع به انجام/استفاده از چیزی متفاوت کنید','spoken & written','to stop doing or using one thing, and start doing or using something else instead','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'انجام یا استفاده از یک چیز را متوقف کنید و به جای آن شروع به انجام یا استفاده از چیز دیگری کنید',array['switch']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['dramatically/drastically/radically (= a lot ) People’s work environment has changed dramatically in the past twenty years.','completely His life had completely changed since he met Anya.','considerably He has changed considerably in four years.','significantly The legal system has changed significantly since the rule was established.','fundamentally The political situation has fundamentally changed.','rapidly/quickly The market for phones is changing rapidly.','slowly/gradually Things are gradually changing.','change overnight (= very quickly ) Old habits cannot be changed overnight.','changing circumstances/conditions The human brain adapts quickly to changing conditions.','changing attitudes Changing attitudes cause traditional ways of life to disappear.','the changing role of somebody the changing role of women in society','changing patterns of work/behaviour etc Changing patterns of work mean that more people are able to work from home.','a changing environment In order to survive, you must adapt to a changing environment.','a changing world Children are growing up in a changing world.','changing times (= a period of time when a lot is changing ) We live in changing times.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She changed jobs in May.","translation":"او در ماه مه شغل خود را تغییر داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667057.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company has recently changed to a more powerful computer system.","translation":"این شرکت اخیراً به یک سیستم کامپیوتری قدرتمندتر تغییر کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667060.mp3"},{"sentence":"The ship changed course and headed south.","translation":"کشتی تغییر مسیر داد و به سمت جنوب حرکت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001069603.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company has had to change direction because of developments in technology.","translation":"این شرکت به دلیل پیشرفت در فناوری مجبور به تغییر مسیر شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667061.mp3"},{"sentence":"Piper awkwardly tried to change the subject (= talk about something else ) .","translation":"پایپر با ناهنجاری سعی کرد موضوع را تغییر دهد (= در مورد چیز دیگری صحبت کنید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667062.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('3ff13b90-13f7-526f-84a5-d68f6e004a7d','6b9e192f-6090-536b-a15c-6f0887215847',3,'replace something','جایگزین کردن چیزی','spoken & written','to put or use something new or different in place of something else, especially because it is old, damaged, or broken','[ transitive ]',null,'قرار دادن یا استفاده از چیزی جدید یا متفاوت به جای چیز دیگری، به ویژه به دلیل قدیمی بودن، آسیب دیده بودن یا شکسته بودن آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['dramatically/drastically/radically (= a lot ) People’s work environment has changed dramatically in the past twenty years.','completely His life had completely changed since he met Anya.','considerably He has changed considerably in four years.','significantly The legal system has changed significantly since the rule was established.','fundamentally The political situation has fundamentally changed.','rapidly/quickly The market for phones is changing rapidly.','slowly/gradually Things are gradually changing.','change overnight (= very quickly ) Old habits cannot be changed overnight.','changing circumstances/conditions The human brain adapts quickly to changing conditions.','changing attitudes Changing attitudes cause traditional ways of life to disappear.','the changing role of somebody the changing role of women in society','changing patterns of work/behaviour etc Changing patterns of work mean that more people are able to work from home.','a changing environment In order to survive, you must adapt to a changing environment.','a changing world Children are growing up in a changing world.','changing times (= a period of time when a lot is changing ) We live in changing times.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Three boys were changing a tyre by the side of the road.","translation":"سه پسر کنار جاده مشغول تعویض لاستیک بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001069654.mp3"},{"sentence":"When I lost my keys, we had to change all the locks.","translation":"وقتی کلیدهایم را گم کردم، مجبور شدیم همه قفل ها را عوض کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667083.mp3"},{"sentence":"The time of the meeting has been changed from 11:00 to 10:30.","translation":"ساعت جلسه از ساعت 11:00 به 10:30 تغییر یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00151.mp3"},{"sentence":"How often do you change cars (= buy a new car and sell the old one ) ?","translation":"چند وقت یکبار ماشین را عوض می کنید (= یک ماشین جدید می خرید و ماشین قدیمی را می فروشید)؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001789744.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('0a356225-fb34-5e29-9e29-0f18743897e4','6b9e192f-6090-536b-a15c-6f0887215847',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'change your mind','تغییر کردن؛ تغییر دادن؛ عوض کردن (قطار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['dramatically/drastically/radically (= a lot ) People’s work environment has changed dramatically in the past twenty years.','completely His life had completely changed since he met Anya.','considerably He has changed considerably in four years.','significantly The legal system has changed significantly since the rule was established.','fundamentally The political situation has fundamentally changed.','rapidly/quickly The market for phones is changing rapidly.','slowly/gradually Things are gradually changing.','change overnight (= very quickly ) Old habits cannot be changed overnight.','changing circumstances/conditions The human brain adapts quickly to changing conditions.','changing attitudes Changing attitudes cause traditional ways of life to disappear.','the changing role of somebody the changing role of women in society','changing patterns of work/behaviour etc Changing patterns of work mean that more people are able to work from home.','a changing environment In order to survive, you must adapt to a changing environment.','a changing world Children are growing up in a changing world.','changing times (= a period of time when a lot is changing ) We live in changing times.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
