nge People sometimes feel alarmed by the pace of technological change.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Even with a change of trains, the subway is quicker than a cab at rush hour.","translation":"حتی با تعویض قطار، مترو در ساعات شلوغی سریعتر از تاکسی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667206.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
