('8b1e37a2-2fcc-5986-9fcd-b3d9248610f5','489f957a-1306-592f-8950-0dd9e851bd9f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a solid food made from milk , which is usually yellow or white in colour , and can be soft or hard',null,null,'پنیر، پنیرِ حیوانی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a piece/bit of cheese Would you like a piece of cheese?','a slice of cheese Sue cut six thin slices of cheese.','a lump/hunk of cheese (= a large piece ) We just had bread and a hunk of cheese for lunch.','a wedge of cheese (= a piece which is thin at one end and thick at the other ) I bought a half pound wedge of cheese.','bread and cheese Lunch was bread and cheese.','cheese and biscuits After the meal we had coffee with cheese and biscuits.','cheese on toast (= melted cheese on toast ) Would you like some cheese on toast?','strong This is one of the strongest French cheeses.','mild (= without a strong taste ) The cheese is mild and creamy.','hard cheese Use a hard cheese such as Cheddar for grating.','soft cheese (= that you can spread ) Camembert is my favourite soft cheese.','grated cheese (= that has been cut into many small pieces using a special tool ) Cover the vegetables with the grated cheese.','melted cheese Nachos are good with melted cheese.','goat''s cheese (= made from goat''s milk )','cream cheese (= a type of soft smooth white cheese )','cottage cheese (= a type of soft white cheese with small lumps in it )','blue cheese (= a type of cheese with blue lines in it and a strong taste )','processed cheese (= with substances added to preserve it )','grate cheese (= cut it into many small pieces using a special tool ) Would you grate some cheese for me?','sprinkle cheese over/on something (= put small pieces of cheese over/on something ) Sprinkle the cheese over the top.','top something with cheese (= put cheese on top of something ) Top the potatoes with grated cheese.','a cheese sandwich I''ll make you a cheese sandwich.','a cheese omelette Lunch was a cheese omelette with salad.','(a) cheese sauce I made a cheese sauce to go with the pasta.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"half a kilo of cheese","translation":"نیم کیلو پنیر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000881816.mp3"},{"sentence":"a cheese sandwich","translation":"یک ساندویچ پنیر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000881817.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sprinkle with the grated cheese.","translation":"با پنیر رنده شده بپاشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652969.mp3"},{"sentence":"a selection of English cheeses","translation":"مجموعه ای از پنیرهای انگلیسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000881818.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('2ddd1be1-c897-56c1-8c0b-f5e8723fd898','489f957a-1306-592f-8950-0dd9e851bd9f',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'(say) cheese!','پنیر، پنیرِ حیوانی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a piece/bit of cheese Would you like a piece of cheese?','a slice of cheese Sue cut six thin slices of cheese.','a lump/hunk of cheese (= a large piece ) We just had bread and a hunk of cheese for lunch.','a wedge of cheese (= a piece which is thin at one end and thick at the other ) I bought a half pound wedge of cheese.','bread and cheese Lunch was bread and cheese.','cheese and biscuits After the meal we had coffee with cheese and biscuits.','cheese on toast (= melted cheese on toast ) Would you like some cheese on toast?','strong This is one of the strongest French cheeses.','mild (= without a strong taste ) The cheese is mild and creamy.','hard cheese Use a hard cheese such as Cheddar for grating.','soft cheese (= that you can spread ) Camembert is my favourite soft cheese.','grated cheese (= that has been cut into many small pieces using a special tool ) Cover the vegetables with the grated cheese.','melted cheese Nachos are good with melted cheese.','goat''s cheese (= made from goat''s milk )','cream cheese (= a type of soft smooth white cheese )','cottage cheese (= a type of soft white cheese with small lumps in it )','blue cheese (= a type of cheese with blue lines in it and a strong taste )','processed cheese (= with substances added to preserve it )','grate cheese (= cut it into many small pieces using a special tool ) Would you grate some cheese for me?','sprinkle cheese over/on something (= put small pieces of cheese over/on something ) Sprinkle the cheese over the top.','top something with cheese (= put cheese on top of something ) Top the potatoes with grated cheese.','a cheese sandwich I''ll make you a cheese sandwich.','a cheese omelette Lunch was a cheese omelette with salad.','(a) cheese sauce I made a cheese sauce to go with the pasta.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b86f2071-d6fd-5953-9980-38192b9a16c8','ed996673-66ee-5cc6-898c-8e23b7579b86',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a printed piece of paper that you write an amount of money on, sign , and use instead of money to pay for things',null,null,'چک، چک بانکی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pay by cheque You can pay by cheque or credit card.','write (out) a cheque I had to write a cheque for £360 yesterday.','give somebody a cheque Can I give you a cheque, or would you prefer cash?','make a cheque out/payable to somebody (= write someone''s name on a cheque so it is paid to them ) Who shall I make the cheque out to?','enclose a cheque (= send it with a letter by post ) I wrote to the company enclosing a cheque for £49.99.','sign a cheque You''ve forgotten to sign the cheque.','pay in a cheque (= pay a cheque into your bank account ) I went to the bank to pay in a couple of cheques.','cancel/stop a cheque (= stop a cheque from being paid to someone ) Don''t forget to phone the bank and cancel that cheque.','cash a cheque (= exchange a cheque for the amount of money it is worth ) The company had cashed the cheque but not sent the goods.','accept a cheque (= take a cheque as a form of payment ) We only accept cheques if you have a bank card.','draw a cheque formal (= use a cheque to withdraw money from an account ) Customers can draw cheques for any amount they like on their accounts.','a cheque bounces (= is not paid by a bank because there is not enough money in the account ) The cheque bounced because my account was overdrawn.','a large cheque (= for a lot of money ) Sara was delighted to receive a large cheque in the post.','a blank cheque (= signed but without the amount written on it ) I wasn''t sure how much the tickets would be so I gave her a blank cheque.','a post-dated cheque (= with a date on it that is later than the date you write the cheque ) She wanted a post-dated cheque for the next three months'' rent.','a pay cheque (= one that you get for doing your job ) My pay cheque arrived at the end of each week.','a traveller''s cheque (= a type of cheque that you can exchange for money in another country ) Are you taking some traveller''s cheques on holiday?','a cheque book (= a book of cheques that your bank gives you to use ) When you open a bank account you will be given your own cheque book.','a cheque card (= a bank card shown when paying by cheque ) Cheques must be accompanied by a valid cheque card.','a cheque stub (= the part of a cheque that stays in your cheque book when you have written a cheque ) Check your cheque stubs to see when you wrote the cheque.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"They sent me a cheque for £100.","translation":"برای من چکی به مبلغ 100 پوند فرستادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000882055.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can I pay by cheque ?","translation":"آیا می توانم با چک پرداخت کنم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000882062.mp3"},{"sentence":"You could write her a cheque .","translation":"می توانید برایش چک بنویسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675576.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2418f675-ee7d-5c41-b89b-fa8e46fec92b','e375b1ab-2c6e-54bc-b6b2-077b6733aea7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a small round red or black fruit with a long thin stem and a stone in the middle','[ countable ]',null,'گیلاس، آلبالو','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a bunch of cherries","translation":"یک دسته گیلاس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000882212.mp3"},{"sentence":"cherry pie","translation":"پای گیلاس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000882213.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('265dc55a-a1be-5ae0-9ff0-8defead4ad27','e375b1ab-2c6e-54bc-b6b2-077b6733aea7',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the tree on which this fruit grows','[ countable ]',null,'درختی که این میوه روی آن رشد می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('62301d3d-20f7-50df-a500-09062762e252','e375b1ab-2c6e-54bc-b6b2-077b6733aea7',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a bright red colour','[ uncountable ]',null,'یک رنگ قرمز روشن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('384fcdfb-4a8b-5228-8595-cb43a52b67e8','c4ad2e19-8339-54f0-980c-83a9e9406565',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if you have a choice, you can choose between several things','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'انتخاب، اختیار؛ گزینه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a choice Students have a choice between German and Spanish.','make a choice (= choose something ) One of our course advisors can help you to make your choice.','give somebody a choice Her doctor gave her a choice: take medicine or lose weight.','be faced with a choice He was faced with a difficult choice.','have no choice (but to do something) The men had no choice but to obey.','leave somebody with no choice I was left with no choice but to resign.','exercise your choice formal (= make a choice – used especially when talking about someone using their right to choose ) Everyone should have the right to exercise choice in matters of relationships.','the right/wrong choice I think you’ve made the right choice.','a difficult choice It was a very difficult choice for me.','a stark choice (= a choice between two unpleasant things that you must make ) We faced a stark choice: steal or starve.','(a) free choice Students have an entirely free choice of what to study at university.','an informed choice (= a choice based on knowledge of the facts about something ) The patient should have enough information to make an informed choice.','consumer choice (= the opportunity for people to choose between different products ) I believe in free trade and consumer choice.','parental choice The aim is to extend parental choice in education.','freedom of choice Patients should have more freedom of choice.','given the choice (= if you had a choice ) Given the choice, I probably wouldn’t work.','have no choice in the matter The village people had no choice in the matter.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Voters have a choice between three main political parties.","translation":"رأی دهندگان بین سه حزب اصلی سیاسی حق انتخاب دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691625.mp3"},{"sentence":"You have a choice of hotel or self-catering accommodation.","translation":"شما می توانید هتل یا محل اقامت خود را انتخاب کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001076418.mp3"},{"sentence":"He has to make some important choices.","translation":"او باید چند انتخاب مهم انجام دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001789796.mp3"},{"sentence":"They gave us no choice in the matter.","translation":"در این مورد به ما چاره ای ندادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691645.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('3ede3392-ac43-57bb-880e-b9e8e22413a1','c4ad2e19-8339-54f0-980c-83a9e9406565',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the range of people or things that you can choose from','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'طیف افراد یا چیزهایی که می توانید از بین آنها انتخاب کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a choice Students have a choice between German and Spanish.','make a choice (= choose something ) One of our course advisors can help you to make your choice.','give somebody a choice Her doctor gave her a choice: take medicine or lose weight.','be faced with a choice He was faced with a difficult choice.','have no choice (but to do something) The men had no choice but to obey.','leave somebody with no choice I was left with no choice but to resign.','exercise your choice formal (= make a choice – used especially when talking about someone using their right to choose ) Everyone should have the right to exercise choice in matters of relationships.','the right/wrong choice I think you’ve made the right choice.','a difficult choice It was a very difficult choice for me.','a stark choice (= a choice between two unpleasant things that you must make ) We faced a stark choice: steal or starve.','(a) free choice Students have an entirely free choice of what to study at university.','an informed choice (= a choice based on knowledge of the facts about something ) The patient should have enough information to make an informed choice.','consumer choice (= the opportunity for people to choose between different products ) I believe in free trade and consumer choice.','parental choice The aim is to extend parental choice in education.','freedom of choice Patients should have more freedom of choice.','given the choice (= if you had a choice ) Given the choice, I probably wouldn’t work.','have no choice in the matter The village people had no choice in the matter.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was a small shop and there wasn’t much choice.","translation":"مغازه کوچکی بود و انتخاب زیادی وجود نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001076453.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is a choice of four different colours.","translation":"امکان انتخاب از چهار رنگ مختلف وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001076456.mp3"},{"sentence":"We offer a wide choice of wines and beers.","translation":"ما انتخاب گسترده ای از شراب و آبجو را ارائه می دهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691667.mp3"},{"sentence":"Consumers these days are spoilt for choice (= have a lot of things to choose from ) .","translation":"مصرف کنندگان این روزها برای انتخاب (= چیزهای زیادی برای انتخاب دارند) بدبخت شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00156.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
