('7be5dcf0-d107-5318-83b2-0980e0cb5392','17f4314c-4365-555a-b830-20856a66b6d0',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who gets services or advice from a professional person, company, or organization',null,null,'مشتری (خدمات حرفه‌ای)؛ کارفرما',array['customer']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['new Most firms are desperate for new clients.','important This is an important client and we do not want to lose her.','a major client (= an important one ) Some of our major clients have not taken the news of the merger well.','a potential/prospective client (= someone who might become a client ) Make sure potential clients know about all of your services.','an existing client (= one that you already have ) We are very keen to keep our existing clients happy.','a private client (= a person rather than a business ) There are more than 200 stockbroking firms eager to take on private clients.','a business client Competition for business clients between travel companies is keen.','a corporate client (= a big company or a group of companies ) Our law firm represents numerous corporate clients.','advise a client The surveyor will advise his client on the value of the property.','act for/on behalf of a client The lawyer will write confirming that he agrees to act for his client.','represent a client Mead was a top attorney representing major corporate clients.','deal with a client They receive training to help them deal with difficult clients.','a client base (= all the people, companies etc that are your clients ) The company quickly expanded its client base in the US.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a meeting with an important client","translation":"ملاقات با یک مشتری مهم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000866405.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b340f899-3b27-5973-ac2e-9e353f22b725','17f4314c-4365-555a-b830-20856a66b6d0',2,null,null,'technical','a computer on a network that receives information from a server (= large powerful computer )',null,null,'یک کامپیوتر در یک شبکه که اطلاعات را از یک سرور دریافت می کند (= کامپیوتر قدرتمند بزرگ)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['new Most firms are desperate for new clients.','important This is an important client and we do not want to lose her.','a major client (= an important one ) Some of our major clients have not taken the news of the merger well.','a potential/prospective client (= someone who might become a client ) Make sure potential clients know about all of your services.','an existing client (= one that you already have ) We are very keen to keep our existing clients happy.','a private client (= a person rather than a business ) There are more than 200 stockbroking firms eager to take on private clients.','a business client Competition for business clients between travel companies is keen.','a corporate client (= a big company or a group of companies ) Our law firm represents numerous corporate clients.','advise a client The surveyor will advise his client on the value of the property.','act for/on behalf of a client The lawyer will write confirming that he agrees to act for his client.','represent a client Mead was a top attorney representing major corporate clients.','deal with a client They receive training to help them deal with difficult clients.','a client base (= all the people, companies etc that are your clients ) The company quickly expanded its client base in the US.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('64c0e3ec-71f0-5f75-9d81-af7299b77df6','24317d3e-4b25-55ab-8edc-7720ba44d609',1,null,null,'spoken & written','not open',null,null,'بسته، تعطیل',array['shut']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Make sure all the windows are closed.","translation":"مطمئن شوید که تمام پنجره ها بسته هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686758.mp3"},{"sentence":"She kept her eyes tightly closed .","translation":"چشمانش را محکم بسته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686759.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('79d1a563-ddf8-5548-af96-616530a5e4ca','24317d3e-4b25-55ab-8edc-7720ba44d609',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if a shop , public building etc is closed, it is not open and people cannot enter or use it','[ not before noun ]',null,'اگر مغازه، ساختمان عمومی و غیره بسته باشد، باز نیست و مردم نمی توانند وارد آن شوند یا از آن استفاده کنند',array['shut']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The shops here are closed on Sundays.","translation":"مغازه های اینجا یکشنبه ها تعطیل هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000867325.mp3"},{"sentence":"The castle is closed to visitors in winter.","translation":"این قلعه در زمستان به روی بازدیدکنندگان بسته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000867328.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
