('3b47f94b-da2d-5b7a-9c64-67bcdb67ba1f','0cee02b3-aa46-5d4c-841e-114f2e8355df',5,'machine','دستگاه','spoken & written','a circular ring that goes round a pipe to make it stronger, especially where two pipes join together',null,null,'حلقه‌ای دایره‌ای که دور یک لوله می‌چرخد تا محکم‌تر شود، مخصوصاً در جایی که دو لوله به هم می‌پیوندند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ca87fb7c-69e1-5c2e-b9d9-4f581c9bd119','0cee02b3-aa46-5d4c-841e-114f2e8355df',6,'coloured fur/feathers','خز/پرهای رنگی','spoken & written','a band of fur , feathers , or skin around an animal’s neck that is a different colour from the rest of the animal',null,null,'نواری از خز، پر یا پوست دور گردن حیوان که رنگ آن با بقیه حیوانات متفاوت است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a9c7dbec-5fa2-5d63-b2f4-c25f76ea5c81','5af7d5cd-bf9c-5c01-9f19-c829e7b41142',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to catch someone and hold them so that they cannot escape',null,null,'گرفتن کسی و نگه داشتن او به گونه ای که نتواند فرار کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The police collared him less than 20 minutes after the robbery.","translation":"پلیس کمتر از 20 دقیقه پس از سرقت به او یقه زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000340.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('10e368c5-70d3-5681-9c47-219a048e1c40','5af7d5cd-bf9c-5c01-9f19-c829e7b41142',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to find someone so that you can talk to them, especially when they would prefer to avoid you',null,null,'برای پیدا کردن کسی که بتوانید با او صحبت کنید، به خصوص زمانی که ترجیح می دهند از شما دوری کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He collared her in the staff room at lunchtime and started telling her about his holiday plans.","translation":"موقع ناهار او را در اتاق کارمندان یقه گرفت و شروع کرد به گفتن برنامه های تعطیلاتش.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000871056.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('68032605-6009-5c2f-83d1-ed929ddd316a','5af7d5cd-bf9c-5c01-9f19-c829e7b41142',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'high-collared/open-collared/fur-collared etc',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a825b84e-9c69-5318-ba9a-1e9207763db8','bca5a627-a512-5850-a81c-73c946d59eea',1,'red/blue/green etc','قرمز/آبی/سبز و غیره','spoken & written','red, blue , yellow , green , brown , purple etc','[ countable ]',null,'رنگ؛ رنگ‌آمیزی؛ رنگین (پوست)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a red/green/blue etc colour Our door was painted a bright green colour.','a reddish/greenish/bluish etc colour (= slightly red, green, blue etc ) The glass used for bottles is often a greenish colour.','a bluey/yellowy/browny colour (= a shade of blue, yellow etc ) I like bluey colours best.','a bright/strong colour (= strong and noticeable ) Bright colours look good in strong sunlight.','a bold/vivid/vibrant colour (= bright in a way that is exciting ) His paintings are known for their use of bold colours.','a rich colour (= strong and beautiful or expensive-looking ) I love the rich colours in oriental rugs.','a dark colour (= more like black than white ) People tend to wear dark colours to work.','a deep colour (= dark and attractive )','a neutral colour (= one that matches other colours easily, for example white or cream )','a light/pale colour (= not dark or strong ) Light colours make a room look larger.','a pastel colour (= pale blue, pink, yellow or green )','a warm colour (= pleasant and containing some red, yellow, or orange ) The old farmhouse is beautifully decorated with warm colours.','a soft colour (= pleasant and not very strong )','a subtle colour (= pleasant, not strong, and a little unusual ) Italian sweaters come in lovely subtle colours.','a loud colour (= very bright in a way that looks unpleasant or funny )','a gaudy/garish colour (= loud and usually showing bad taste )','contrasting colours (= ones that are different from each other in a way that looks attractive ) You need to have one or two contrasting colours in the room.','complementary colours (= ones that look nice together ) Plant the flowers in patches in complementary colours.','a matching colour (= one that is the same as something else ) I bought some gloves and a scarf in a matching colour.','a primary colour (= red, yellow, or blue ) Why are children’s toys always in primary colours?','a colour matches something (= it is the same colour ) The colour in this tin of paint doesn’t match the walls.','a colours clashes (with something) (= is different from something in a way that is unattractive ) Do you think the colour of this tie clashes with my shirt?','a colour fades (= loses colour and brightness ) The colour of the curtains had faded in the sun.','a colour scheme (= the colours that you use in a room, painting etc ) Have you decided on a colour scheme?','a colour combination/combination of colours (= the colours that exist or that you put together ) In autumn the leaves create lovely colour combinations.','a colour range/range of colours (= a number of colours that you can choose from ) There’s a wide colour range to choose from.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"What colour dress did you buy?","translation":"چه رنگ لباسی خریدی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001088671.mp3"},{"sentence":"What colour are his eyes?","translation":"چشماش چه رنگیه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695418.mp3"},{"sentence":"The pens come in a wide range of colours.","translation":"قلم ها در طیف گسترده ای از رنگ ها عرضه می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695419.mp3"},{"sentence":"I love wearing bright colours.","translation":"من عاشق پوشیدن رنگ های روشن هستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001088675.mp3"},{"sentence":"The walls were a lovely reddish-brown color.","translation":"رنگ دیوارها قهوه ای مایل به قرمز دوست داشتنی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001088678.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('fd6500c6-1944-56fe-b3d5-de717837d5ad','bca5a627-a512-5850-a81c-73c946d59eea',2,'colour in general','رنگ به طور کلی','spoken & written','the appearance of something as a result of the way it reflect s (= throws back ) light, especially when its appearance is very bright or is made up of a lot of different colours','[ uncountable ]',null,'ظاهر چیزی در نتیجه انعکاس نور (= به عقب پرتاب می کند)، به خصوص زمانی که ظاهر آن بسیار روشن است یا از رنگ های مختلف تشکیل شده باشد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a red/green/blue etc colour Our door was painted a bright green colour.','a reddish/greenish/bluish etc colour (= slightly red, green, blue etc ) The glass used for bottles is often a greenish colour.','a bluey/yellowy/browny colour (= a shade of blue, yellow etc ) I like bluey colours best.','a bright/strong colour (= strong and noticeable ) Bright colours look good in strong sunlight.','a bold/vivid/vibrant colour (= bright in a way that is exciting ) His paintings are known for their use of bold colours.','a rich colour (= strong and beautiful or expensive-looking ) I love the rich colours in oriental rugs.','a dark colour (= more like black than white ) People tend to wear dark colours to work.','a deep colour (= dark and attractive )','a neutral colour (= one that matches other colours easily, for example white or cream )','a light/pale colour (= not dark or strong ) Light colours make a room look larger.','a pastel colour (= pale blue, pink, yellow or green )','a warm colour (= pleasant and containing some red, yellow, or orange ) The old farmhouse is beautifully decorated with warm colours.','a soft colour (= pleasant and not very strong )','a subtle colour (= pleasant, not strong, and a little unusual ) Italian sweaters come in lovely subtle colours.','a loud colour (= very bright in a way that looks unpleasant or funny )','a gaudy/garish colour (= loud and usually showing bad taste )','contrasting colours (= ones that are different from each other in a way that looks attractive ) You need to have one or two contrasting colours in the room.','complementary colours (= ones that look nice together ) Plant the flowers in patches in complementary colours.','a matching colour (= one that is the same as something else ) I bought some gloves and a scarf in a matching colour.','a primary colour (= red, yellow, or blue ) Why are children’s toys always in primary colours?','a colour matches something (= it is the same colour ) The colour in this tin of paint doesn’t match the walls.','a colours clashes (with something) (= is different from something in a way that is unattractive ) Do you think the colour of this tie clashes with my shirt?','a colour fades (= loses colour and brightness ) The colour of the curtains had faded in the sun.','a colour scheme (= the colours that you use in a room, painting etc ) Have you decided on a colour scheme?','a colour combination/combination of colours (= the colours that exist or that you put together ) In autumn the leaves create lovely colour combinations.','a colour range/range of colours (= a number of colours that you can choose from ) There’s a wide colour range to choose from.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Bright bold accessories are the quickest way to add colour to a room.","translation":"اکسسوری های پررنگ و روشن سریع ترین راه برای رنگ دادن به اتاق هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695429.mp3"},{"sentence":"The wine was almost pink in colour (= was almost pink ) .","translation":"رنگ شراب تقریبا صورتی بود (= تقریبا صورتی بود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695435.mp3"},{"sentence":"In summer the gardens are a blaze of colour.","translation":"در تابستان، باغ ها رنگارنگ هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695442.mp3"},{"sentence":"a splash of colour (= a small area of a bright colour )","translation":"پاشیدن رنگ (= ناحیه کوچکی از رنگ روشن)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695443.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sky began to slowly change colour .","translation":"آسمان کم کم شروع به تغییر رنگ کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695446.mp3"},{"sentence":"the fall colors (= the colours of the trees in autumn )","translation":"رنگ های پاییز (= رنگ درختان در پاییز)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001088688.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
