('63252172-fdab-5aa6-93e5-f28f1dd72321','f4e743d2-004e-5c64-8ebd-a44c376af0ed',3,'education','آموزش و پرورش','spoken & written','a series of lessons in a particular subject','[ countable ]',null,'مجموعه ای از درس ها در یک موضوع خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['take a course ( also do a course British English ) I decided to do a course in Italian.','go on a course British English My company wanted me to go on a course in management skills.','pass/fail a course If you pass the course, you get a diploma in psychology.','apply for a course The following year she applied for a nursing course.','enrol on a course/put your name down for a course British English (= to arrange to officially join a course ) How about enrolling on a sailing course?','attend a course formal (= take part in a course ) You’ll have to attend a course on how to deal with customers on the phone.','withdraw from a course/drop out of a course (= leave it without finishing it ) She had to withdraw from the course because of illness.','teach a course She is teaching an introductory course in Russian.','run a course The course is run by the British Council.','offer a course The course is offered on a part-time basis.','change (your) course (= at university or college ) Some students choose to change their course after the first year.','a language/art/design etc course The school runs ten-week language courses three times a year.','a full-time/part-time course There are also part-time courses for mature students.','an elementary/intermediate/advanced course an advanced course in art and design','a one-year/two-year etc course She did a one-year teacher training course.','a short course I did a short course on website design.','an intensive course (= in which you learn a lot in a short time ) An intensive course in Russian is provided for those who do not already know the language.','a crash course informal (= in which you learn a great deal in a very short time ) A husband was given a crash course in how to deliver a baby by a midwife on the phone.','a training course If you are offered the job, you will attend a two-week training course.','a vocational course (= that trains you to do a particular job ) a vocational course in architecture','a college/university course students who fail their college courses','a degree course British English ( also an undergraduate course ) (= a first course at a university, which usually lasts three years ) a three-year degree course','a postgraduate course British English (= one you do after your first degree course )','a correspondence course (= in which you work at home, sending work to a teacher by post )','an introductory course (= for people who have never done a particular subject or activity before )','an induction course (= that you do when you start a new job or position )','a refresher course (= short and intended to teach you about new developments in a subject )','a foundation course British English (= a general course that students do in the first year at some universities )','a sandwich course British English (= that includes periods of work in industry or business )','a tailor-made course (= one that is specially designed for someone ) a tailor-made course to help senior staff develop their negotiation skills','a course tutor British English: I discussed it with my course tutor.','course material Teachers are provided with course material.','the course syllabus (= the plan of what is taught on a course ) The school has recently introduced a new course syllabus.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Andy’s doing a one-year journalism course.","translation":"اندی در حال گذراندن دوره یک ساله روزنامه نگاری است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001114146.mp3"},{"sentence":"a course on architecture","translation":"دوره معماری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001114149.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m taking a course in graphic design.","translation":"من در حال گذراندن دوره طراحی گرافیک هستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001114152.mp3"},{"sentence":"a degree course in photography","translation":"دوره لیسانس عکاسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000388.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('57bf965d-2e5f-598a-a4d0-a0bf7f8afd3a','f4e743d2-004e-5c64-8ebd-a44c376af0ed',4,'time','زمان','spoken & written','a period of time or process during which something happens','[ singular ]',null,'یک دوره زمانی یا فرآیندی که در طی آن چیزی اتفاق می افتد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"During the course of our conversation, it emerged that Bob had been in prison.","translation":"در جریان گفتگوی ما معلوم شد که باب در زندان بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680865.mp3"},{"sentence":"Over the course of the next few years, the steel industry was reorganized.","translation":"در طول چند سال بعد، صنعت فولاد سازماندهی مجدد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680866.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the course of researching customer needs, we discovered how few families have adequate life insurance.","translation":"در جریان تحقیق در مورد نیازهای مشتریان، متوجه شدیم که تعداد کمی از خانواده ها دارای بیمه عمر کافی هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680869.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('f7a33eb7-43fa-5cd8-b387-18caae43e219','f4e743d2-004e-5c64-8ebd-a44c376af0ed',5,'development','توسعه','spoken & written','the usual or natural way that something changes, develops , or is done','[ singular ]',null,'روش معمول یا طبیعی که چیزی تغییر می کند، توسعه می یابد یا انجام می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"forces that shape the course of evolution","translation":"نیروهایی که مسیر تکامل را شکل می دهند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680873.mp3"},{"sentence":"Meeting Sally changed the whole course of his life .","translation":"ملاقات با سالی کل مسیر زندگی او را تغییر داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001114189.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the normal course of events, a son would inherit from his father.","translation":"در روال عادی وقایع، یک پسر از پدرش ارث می برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001114192.mp3"},{"sentence":"Relax and let nature take its course .","translation":"آرام باشید و بگذارید طبیعت مسیر خود را طی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680882.mp3"},{"sentence":"It seems the boom in World Music has run its course.","translation":"به نظر می رسد که رونق موسیقی جهانی مسیر خود را طی کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000389.mp3"},{"sentence":"Gorbachev changed the course of Soviet history.","translation":"گورباچف ​​مسیر تاریخ شوروی را تغییر داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000390.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('6dcae317-21ec-59e7-aaef-30558ecb5362','f4e743d2-004e-5c64-8ebd-a44c376af0ed',6,'plans','برنامه ها','spoken & written','the general plans someone has to achieve something or the general way something is happening','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'برنامه های کلی که کسی برای دستیابی به چیزی دارد یا روش کلی که چیزی اتفاق می افتد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They will go to any lengths to get the White House to change course .","translation":"آنها تمام تلاش خود را خواهند کرد تا مسیر کاخ سفید را تغییر دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000391.mp3"},{"sentence":"He will steer a middle course between pacifism and revolution.","translation":"او مسیری میانه بین صلح طلبی و انقلاب را هدایت خواهد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680902.mp3"},{"sentence":"As long as the economy stays on course , the future looks rosy.","translation":"تا زمانی که اقتصاد در مسیر خود باقی بماند، آینده درخشان به نظر می رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680906.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('9e7b2901-35a8-5fb0-849e-2858c1bee578','f4e743d2-004e-5c64-8ebd-a44c376af0ed',7,'actions','اقدامات','spoken & written','an action or series of actions that you could take in order to deal with a particular situation','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'اقدام یا مجموعه ای از اقداماتی که می توانید برای مقابله با یک موقعیت خاص انجام دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I agreed that this was the only sensible course of action .","translation":"من قبول کردم که این تنها اقدام معقول بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680911.mp3"},{"sentence":"The judge took the only course of action open to him.","translation":"قاضی تنها راهی را که برای او باز بود در پیش گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001114179.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('607fe6f2-c96f-5c95-b839-1398ac13653e','f4e743d2-004e-5c64-8ebd-a44c376af0ed',8,'direction','جهت','spoken & written','the planned direction taken by a boat or plane to reach a place','[ countable usually singular, uncountable ]',null,'جهت برنامه ریزی شده توسط قایق یا هواپیما برای رسیدن به یک مکان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The plane changed course to avoid the storm.","translation":"هواپیما برای جلوگیری از طوفان مسیر خود را تغییر داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680918.mp3"},{"sentence":"The ship was blown off course .","translation":"کشتی از مسیر منفجر شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001114213.mp3"},{"sentence":"The aircraft was almost ten miles off course.","translation":"هواپیما تقریباً ده مایل از مسیر دور بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000392.mp3"},{"sentence":"She tightened the mainsail while holding the course (= travelling in the same direction as planned ) .","translation":"او بادبان اصلی را در حالی که دوره را برگزار می کرد سفت کرد (= در همان جهتی که برنامه ریزی شده بود سفر می کرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001833965.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
