riod.','interest-free credit (= with no interest added to it ) We offer interest-free credit for up to 50 weeks.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I don’t have enough credits to graduate.","translation":"من اعتبار کافی برای فارغ التحصیلی ندارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001119217.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
