('8709b498-8cf4-55d2-ac90-0654910c3756','c7d9cb55-832c-5cd9-9fa3-d5993a4f93b2',1,null,null,'informal','someone who is trained to treat people who are ill',null,null,'پزشک، طبیب؛ دکتر (فارغ‌التحصیل)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go to the doctor I’d been having bad headaches so I went to the doctor.','see a doctor ( also visit a doctor American English ) (= go to the doctor ) Have you seen a doctor about it yet?','ask a doctor ( also consult a doctor formal ) If you have any of these symptoms, you should consult a doctor.','call a doctor (= telephone one, especially to ask them to come to you ) His mother was very worried and called the doctor.','get a doctor (= arrange for one to come to you ) In the middle of the night we decided to get the doctor.','a doctor examines somebody The doctor examined her and said she had a chest infection.','a doctor prescribes something (= writes an order for medicine for someone ) My doctor prescribed a course of antibiotics.','a doctor diagnoses flu/depression etc (= says what illness someone has ) The doctor diagnosed malaria.','a family doctor (= who treats all the members of a family ) We’ve had the same family doctor for fifteen years.','somebody’s local doctor (= working near where you live ) You should go and see your local doctor.','a hospital doctor British English (= working in a hospital ) Junior hospital doctors have to work very long hours.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She was treated by her local doctor.","translation":"او توسط پزشک محلی خود تحت درمان قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001975414.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d like to make an appointment to see Dr Pugh.","translation":"من می خواهم یک قرار ملاقات بگذارم تا دکتر پوگ را ببینم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689537.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Where’s Sandy today?’ ‘I think she’s at the doctor’s.’","translation":"«سندی امروز کجاست؟» «فکر می‌کنم او پیش دکتر است.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689542.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
