('953fd0d3-f5f5-58a9-b10c-ba9246637622','16edb25d-8dd0-50df-8ff4-5e2902e266d1',24,null,null,'spoken & written','to look at the messages sent by a particular person using the social networking service Twitter','[ transitive ]',null,'برای مشاهده پیام های ارسال شده توسط یک شخص خاص با استفاده از سرویس شبکه اجتماعی توییتر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('357446b5-ffa3-5e9c-ab47-b907cf6ec2b1','33a8f746-3e0d-5bc9-ad92-029746bdcb6b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a large area of land that is covered with trees',null,'rain forest , → not see the forest for the trees','جنگل، بیشه؛ انبوه (برج‌ها)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a thick/dense forest (= with trees that are growing close together ) The country we passed through was once thick forest.','a pine/beech/birch etc forest A narrow path led through the pine forest.','a tropical forest (= in tropical areas of the world ) South East Asia’s topical rain forests','a deciduous forest (= with trees that lose their leaves in winter ) a deciduous forest of red oak trees','a coniferous forest (= with pine or fir trees ) We entered a dark coniferous forest.','virgin forest (= forest that has not been used or changed by people ) Here virgin forest remains that is at least a thousand years old.','a primeval forest (= forest which has existed since ancient times ) One of Europe’s last areas of primeval forest is threatened with destruction.','plant a forest Large areas of forest have been planted.','clear a forest (= cut down and remove the trees ) Huge areas of forest have been cleared since 1960.','cut down a forest The forest was cut down to make way for housing.','be covered in forest The mountain slopes were covered in forest.','a forest fire Forest fires have broken out across the region.','the forest floor (= the ground in a forest ) The forest floor was carpeted with leaves.','the forest canopy (= the area at the top of the trees ) He could see the sky through the gaps in the forest canopy.','forest management (= controlling the way a forest grows and is used ) The main aim of forest management is timber production.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Much of Scandinavia is covered in dense forest.","translation":"بخش اعظم اسکاندیناوی پوشیده از جنگل های انبوه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751566.mp3"},{"sentence":"a tropical forest","translation":"یک جنگل استوایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751567.mp3"},{"sentence":"the danger of forest fires","translation":"خطر آتش سوزی جنگل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270611.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('0389ee76-3f69-56ba-ad95-0490767e9c40','c3ed0f44-ec5f-52a1-ba4f-be3d208a70f5',1,'facts/information','حقایق/اطلاعات','spoken','to not remember facts , information , or people or things from the past','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'فراموش کردن؛ جا انداختن (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’m sorry, I’ve forgotten your name.","translation":"متاسفم، نام شما را فراموش کرده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270949.mp3"},{"sentence":"I know you told me, but I forgot.","translation":"میدونم بهم گفتی ولی یادم رفت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751642.mp3"},{"sentence":"What happened that day will never be forgotten.","translation":"آنچه در آن روز اتفاق افتاد هرگز فراموش نخواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751643.mp3"},{"sentence":"Karl says he forgot about our date.","translation":"کارل می گوید که تاریخ ما را فراموش کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270955.mp3"},{"sentence":"She forgot all about their anniversary.","translation":"او همه چیز را در مورد سالگرد آنها فراموش کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751644.mp3"},{"sentence":"I forgot that there’s a speed limit here.","translation":"فراموش کردم که اینجا محدودیت سرعت وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270952.mp3"},{"sentence":"How can you forget where you’ve parked the car?","translation":"چگونه می توانید فراموش کنید که ماشین را کجا پارک کرده اید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270958.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s someone who never forgets a face (= forgets who someone is ) .","translation":"او کسی است که هرگز چهره ای را فراموش نمی کند (= فراموش می کند که کسی کیست).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751648.mp3"},{"sentence":"Oh yes, I was forgetting she was pregnant.","translation":"اوه بله، داشتم فراموش می کردم که حامله است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751657.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('e5d84528-9f9a-5253-8575-85ee0fe907d8','c3ed0f44-ec5f-52a1-ba4f-be3d208a70f5',2,'something you must do','کاری که باید انجام دهید','spoken & written','to not remember to do something that you should do','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'یادت نره کاری رو که باید انجام بدی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘Did you remember to post that letter?’ ‘Oh, sorry, I forgot.’","translation":"«یادت رفت آن نامه را پست کنی؟» «اوه، ببخشید، فراموش کردم.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270963.mp3"},{"sentence":"Give me your phone number before I forget (= forget to get it ) .","translation":"قبل از اینکه فراموش کنم شماره تلفن خود را به من بدهید (= فراموش کنم آن را دریافت کنم).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751659.mp3"},{"sentence":"Someone’s forgotten to turn off their headlights.","translation":"یک نفر فراموش کرده چراغ جلویش را خاموش کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751666.mp3"},{"sentence":"He meant to invite Monica, but he clean forgot.","translation":"او قصد داشت مونیکا را دعوت کند، اما فراموش کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751671.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('44d4c856-487b-58cd-a469-e07d40f7cd2d','c3ed0f44-ec5f-52a1-ba4f-be3d208a70f5',3,'leave something somewhere','چیزی را جایی بگذار','spoken & written','to not remember to bring something that you need with you','[ transitive ]',null,'یادتان نرود چیزی را که نیاز دارید با خود بیاورید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Oh no, I’ve forgotten my wallet.","translation":"اوه نه، کیف پولم را فراموش کرده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751680.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5ae8f951-ea85-580f-afc6-d289decb9587','c3ed0f44-ec5f-52a1-ba4f-be3d208a70f5',4,'stop thinking about','دست از فکر کردن بردارید','spoken & written','to stop thinking or worrying about someone or something','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'دست از فکر کردن یا نگرانی در مورد کسی یا چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Forget him, he’s not worth it.","translation":"او را فراموش کن، او ارزشش را ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270979.mp3"},{"sentence":"At my age, I think I can forget fashion.","translation":"در سن من فکر می کنم می توانم مد را فراموش کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751694.mp3"},{"sentence":"After a while you’ll forget you’re wearing contact lenses.","translation":"پس از مدتی فراموش خواهید کرد که از لنزهای تماسی استفاده می کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751697.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll never be able to forget about the accident.","translation":"من هرگز نمی توانم تصادف را فراموش کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270982.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('07398c15-8e98-53f8-8689-5b61529bcd80','c3ed0f44-ec5f-52a1-ba4f-be3d208a70f5',5,'not care about','اهمیتی نمی دهد','spoken & written','to not care about or give attention to someone or something any longer','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'دیگر به کسی یا چیزی اهمیت ندادن یا به آن توجه نکردند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Don’t forget about your old friends when you go off to college, okay?","translation":"وقتی به دانشگاه می روید دوستان قدیمی خود را فراموش نکنید، خوب؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270990.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can’t afford to forget your relationship with your husband.","translation":"شما نمی توانید رابطه خود را با شوهرتان فراموش کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751698.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('67d5e376-1131-5686-8f8f-f606db7db61a','c3ed0f44-ec5f-52a1-ba4f-be3d208a70f5',6,'stop a plan','توقف یک طرح','spoken & written','to stop planning to do something because it is no longer possible or sensible','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'از برنامه ریزی برای انجام کاری دست بردارید زیرا دیگر ممکن یا معقول نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’ll have to forget about going on holiday.","translation":"ما باید تعطیلات رفتن را فراموش کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270998.mp3"},{"sentence":"If we can’t get any funding we might as well forget the whole thing .","translation":"اگر نتوانیم بودجه دریافت کنیم، ممکن است همه چیز را فراموش کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001270999.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
